window.products.push({"id":861109,"name":"IMPRESA [100 Pack] Wine To Go Bag - Use For Restaurant, Bar & Travel Bags - Sturdy Handle And Tamper Proof Seal - Clear Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UtQmfiodL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100 Wine To Go Bags By Impresa Products No wine should be left behind! That's why our 100 pack of wine take-home bags are the perfect way for you to transport your favorite unfinished restaurantwine to enjoy in the comfort of your home.It's simple to use these handy bags: just place your bottle into your winedoggie bag, peel and seal! You can now transport your wine without spillageand with peace of mind that you are adhering to open container laws in many States. Our true value pack of 100 doggy bags are perfect for the restaurantand bar trade bringing you great quality bags at fantastic affordability. Key Features: - Value Pack (100 bags) -Secure tamper-proof seal -Strong Carry Handle -Fits bottles up to 750ml","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UtQmfiodL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMPRESA","source_asin":"B08Z6HTLTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z6HTLTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z6HTLTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861110,"name":"Abstract Devil‘s’ Last Supper by Andrea Solari Wall Art Decor - Day of the Dead Halloween Theme Canvas Prints Painting Pictures Posters Artwork Modern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OnlWS8FtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large canvas printing wall artwork -DJSYLIFE brand honorary product is shown to you directly. Scope of Application: Perfect SIZE for over the Sofa,Bed or Bathroom wall. Applicable place: Painting's love to wall is for a lifetime. Canvas wall art and canvas paint present our pursuit to good lives. They are suitable for decoration of dining room, living room, restaurant and office. Wherever you see it, you will feel relaxed, happy and fascinated by its beauty. A piece of good combinations of painting will be the focus of indoor and gets your praise. Advice for install: A gap of 3-5cm should be allowed between each art frame during assemblies. Important reminder when you choose the size of the art frame: *Please measure the wall of your room before picking the right size of your product. *There might be small discrepancy on the size of our art frames because all our art frames are processed by hand. All dimensions are subject to real products. *Size tolerance: +/-1cm *REMINDER: The images of product in the photos are just for the purpose of presentation to how the product looks in a room. It doesn’t present the real appearance of the product in the showroom. It doesn’t present the real size of the product, either. About color difference: Colour may look slightly different from different displays because the brand, brightness and contract of each display may be differnt. About delivery: *Ship in 3 days for paid items. *Delay on the shipment may occur under uncontrollable conditions like bad weather, which will require more time to ship. *Free return or refund for damages on products during shipping. Guaranty: Guaranty subject to Amazon’s policy of assurance for 100% return goods. For any questions and requests, contact us and we’ll handle for you in 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OnlWS8FtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DJSYLIFE","source_asin":"B07YBCJ616","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBCJ616","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBCJ616","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861111,"name":"Set of 2 LiteRays LED Light Up Projection LitePod Table Center Piece/Drink Accessory- Stripes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6130B2o0TnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LiteRays LED projection LitePods project 7 different dazzling colors: red, green, blue, light yellow, Cyan, pink and white. There is also a multimode color changing setting where the glass will slowly phase through all of the colors automatically. Simply push down on the pod to cycle through each color setting. This particular model projects a stripes themed pattern all around the base of the pod. It runs on 2 common CR2032 batteries which are easily replaceable by removing the 2 screws and pulling away the silicone cover from the electronics. LiteRays are best enjoyed in a low light or dark environment. Each pod comes with its own 'sticky pad' which can be adhered easily to any smooth flat surface, such as a wall, cabinets, or as most use them for; the bottom of a drinking glass. Best of all, the sticky pad can be cleaned and reused, so there is never a need to buy replacements. Simply remove the sticky pad from the pod and run it under warm water to wash away dust and particulates. For drinking glasses, these pods work best with libby 16oz style glasses or pilsners. They measure just under 2.5 inches across, so with all of the styles of glasses available there is a large multitude of possibilities. Please note while LiteRays LitePods are water resistant, they are NOT water proof. Hand wash with a slightly damp cloth only! What are the uses for LiteRays LitePods? The possibilities are largely limited to your imagination but here are just a few helpful suggestions: - Use as a wedding plate centerpiece with candy inside or a small flower - Use as a child's bedside night light - Use a party or mood lighting - Use as a light source inside a glass vase or center piece - Use as a name place holders at a dinner party - Use as a patio lighting accessory This product can be customized with customer supplied images and/or text! Contact us for details. Make your next special event a unique and memorable one with LiteRays projection LitePods!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6130B2o0TnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIRECTGLOW LLC","source_asin":"B00GZG8XIE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GZG8XIE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GZG8XIE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
