window.products.push({"id":861133,"name":"HOME-X Onion & Garlic Saver Bags, Reusable Produce Storage Sack for Vegetables–Natural-14 ¾” L x 10 ½” W (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nCsWz+HfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These handy storage bag will make an excellent addition to your kitchen supplies. They are designed specifically to preserve and protect produce. Although specifically intended for onion and garlic, these bags can also be used for a myriad of other fruits and vegetables, like potatoes, shallots, turnips, yams, and so much more. Overexposure to light and air can cause many types of fruits and vegetables to sprout and ripen or rot prematurely, which is why we designed these useful bags with a black polyester lining for extra protection. These bag's breathable cotton/polyester design helps allow ethylene gas to escape, further extending the life of your produce. Plastic bags are harmful to the environment and often cause fruits and veggies to ripen more quickly. Purchase multiple reusable storage bags to use while grocery shopping and for storing multiple types of produce at once. The cute, vintage design will also complement your kitchen decor. These bags are incredibly easy to store. You can hang them from hooks in your kitchen or pantry, or you can simply place them on a convenient shelf or cabinet. We designed these useful bags with a drawstring closure for easy loading and access to whatever you place inside. We also added a useful side-zip opening so you can easily grab and rotate stock. With the help of one of these bags, you'll preserve and extend the life of your produce, saving you trips to the store and helping you reduce waste overall. As an added bonus, these bags are reusable and washable, so you can use them over and over again. Add these onion and garlic bags to your kitchen supplies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nCsWz+HfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B088CX249Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088CX249Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088CX249Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
