window.products.push({"id":861216,"name":"ICO 0.5 Liter (1 Pint) Professional Stainless Steel Whipped Cream Dispenser for Homemade Whipping Cream, Whipped Cream Maker for Desserts, Dips, Sauce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hbRh9EgAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Professional- The ICO whip cream dispenser in stainless steel is industrial grade and intended for professional kitchens and heavy use. A cream whipper designed for baristas, caterers, and chefs. Ideal also for home use. Ideal for Keto or Paleo enthusiasts needing to control the ingredients on toppings and dips. Perfect for preparing creams, desserts, sweet or savory mousses, aerated hot or cold sauces, soups, foams, dips, fruit and vegetable emulsions, infused oils and liquors. Stainless Steel Construction - Made of TUV Certified 100% stainless steel and tested to ensure it can undergo the necessary pressures for your safety (TUV GS Safety Mark Certified). Perfect for both cold and warm preparations, this whip cream maker can be used with ingredients with a temperature of up to 40 C/104 F degrees. Designed will all food-grade materials for chemical-free preparations that are safe for consumption. Convenient & Easy Clean Up- Insulated design to keep cream fresh, it whips 1 pint of liquid cream into over 2 quarts of delicious whipped cream that will keep in your fridge for up to 14 days. All stainless steel parts are dishwasher safe. The stainless steel piston and silicone seal are removable for easy and hygienic cleaning. **Use with 8g N2O whipped cream charger (nitrous oxide chargers) for all preparations and with 2g N2 chargers for Nitro coffee. Trusted Brand- ICO is a European brand with over 20 years’ experience in bakeware and sales history in Europe, the USA, Canada, Mexico, Central America, and Israel. The ICO Whipped Cream Dispenser Stainless Steel includes: 3 stainless steel (straight, bullet, and tulip style) decorator tips, 1 aluminum charger holder, 1 protective cap for puncture needle, 1 cleaning brush, and Instruction manual. Full Money Back Guarantee - If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase or have any problems with it, you can either return the product for a full refund or you can contact us to solve the problem. We include a 2-year warranty which covers any manufacturing defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hbRh9EgAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impeccable Culinary Objects (ICO)","source_asin":"B08KSG8NJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSG8NJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSG8NJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
