window.products.push({"id":861345,"name":"24V/12V Car Universal Electric Heating Travel Mug, Constant Tempe 0℃~100℃ Adjustable, Airtight Heating, Leakproof, Food-Grade 304 Stainless Steel Vacu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gi0nZ4lmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please contact us in time if you have any questions after receiving the goods, we will reply to you within 24 hours SPECIAL PRECAUTIONS, MUST SEE. When the heating temperature exceeds 50 ℃, it cannot be inverted immediately. Because the air pressure in the cup is higher than the outside during heating, the pressure relief valve is open, and water will flow out of the air pressure hole when it is inverted directly，please to avoid burns. Our electric heating travel cup has undergone 3 years of R&D and manufacturing, has 5 major patents, 8 original functions, dual-use for car and home 【Home use requires a separate home power adapter（Not Included)】 Innovative Features: 1，Built-in rechargeable battery, real-time detection of water temperature and TDS value in the cup even if the power cord is unplugged, standby time can exceed 30 days. 2，Vacuum insulation, the insulation effect can reach 8 hours. 3，The cup body adopts IP57 waterproof and dustproof design, which can wash the whole body of the product in a short time. (Ensure that the interface is dry when plugging in the power cord) 4，Double anti-dry burning protection, double steam pressure relief protection, double overheating temperature protection. Prevent leakage of water and electricity. 5，The four-speed working power is adjustable. For a few current-limited car models, the cup power can be adjusted to adapt to the current-limited car models. Technical Parameter: Capacity: 380 mL Size: High 212mm, Bottom diameter 72mm, Upper part diameter 77mm Votage: DC12V~28V Power: 24W/48W/72W/96W Adjustable Cup Body Material: Double layer Food grade 304 stainless steel vacuum cup Temperature Control: 0℃~100 ℃ Multiple Uses: All car models. One-key Function：Default functions - Boil, Tea(With tea strainer), Coffee, Milk, Warm, TDS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gi0nZ4lmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shonmau","source_asin":"B08SBRW5VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SBRW5VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SBRW5VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
