window.products.push({"id":861449,"name":"HOTZON Blue Air Mattress with Built in Pump, Twin Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VyhoH0eeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛌【SIMPLE& HIGH-SPEED AUTO-INFLATION】 Built-in electric air pump, the air bed reaches full inflation/deflation in 3-5 mins(Queen: 5-8mins), which could keep inflatable for a period of time. 🛌【STRICT LEAK-PROOF & ANTI-SKID 】 Comprised of 0.65mm extra thick waterproof flocked top & 0.45mm durable puncture resistant PVC, our air mattress not only make you feel comfy but prevent leakage or movement. Extra spinal support and coil beam construction ensures maximum comfort! 🛌【LIGHTWEIGHT AND PORTABLE】 Weighing only 18.5 pounds, so ultra-light the air mattress is. Come with a carrying case, you can pack and store it easily if not use. 🛌【FAMILY EXCLUSIVE】 Designed for home use, it is perfect to place the inflatable bed in living room& bedroom or rest in courtyard. When you move house or for your houseguests, a extra &temporary bed it would, easily solve sleeping problems. 🛌【EXTRA FEATURE】 Queen air mattress can accommodate 3 people, loading up to 660lbs( Twin:330lbs). 18\" elevated height make you get into and out of bed easier, which is suitable for all body types and sleeping positions, making you sleep like a baby! 🛌【WARM TIPS】Kindly Tighten and check manual valve again after inflation, prevent air leakage; Return to \"OFF\" position of switch, keep it inflatable. Any questions pls feel free to contact us, our customer service team aims to provide you with the best experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VyhoH0eeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTOZON","source_asin":"B09PQM1Q8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PQM1Q8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PQM1Q8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861450,"name":"GRACED SOFT LUXURIES Throw Blankets Woven Soft for Sofa Couch Decorative Knitted Farmhouse Fringe Blanket (Cashew, Large 50\" x 60\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i2fOv97RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHIC DESIGN: This premium cashew fringe throw blanket features an elegant decorative fringe and geometric diamond pattern for added style. It's the perfect addition to living rooms, guest rooms, bedrooms, family rooms, couches, sofas and more. CONSTRUCTION & SIZE: Made of 100% high quality eco-friendly acrylic, our 50” x 60“ fringe throw blankets are artfully crafted to be silky soft, lightweight and thin yet cozy and warm. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: This high quality soft & comfy fringe throw blanket does not shed & has a 365 manufacturer warranty. VERSATILE: Perfect for snuggling up on the couch, bed and as decorative centerpiece for your home. Impress your friends, family, co-workers, clients and others by gifting this high end luxury throw. EASY TO CARE FOR: Machine washable on cold, tumble dry on low. The color will not fade, fabric will shed even after multiple wash cycles and endless use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i2fOv97RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRACED SOFT LUXURIES","source_asin":"B084GFS5CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084GFS5CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084GFS5CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861451,"name":"Sur La Table Spanish Paella Pan, 15\", Serves 8, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6oLqoo0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Used for centuries in Spain, the paella pan distributes heat evenly and becomes naturally seasoned with use. Safe for the oven, stovetop or outdoor grill. Note: pans over 18\" won’t fit on a standard stovetop. Made in Spain. Serving sizes: 13½\" pan: 6 people; 15\" pan: 8 people; 17\" pan: 10 people; 22\" pan: 16 people. Care and Use of Paella Pan:First time use: Boil water in the receptacle.. Wash with water and detergent. Dry immediately. Never leave to air-dry.. The product is now ready to use; smear the interior with a light layer of oil to prepare it to better withstand the heat when cooking.. If you are not going to use the product straight away, lightly oil the interior and keep it wrapped in paper inside a plastic bag. Keep in a safe, dry place.. This type of product does not have a non-stick surface so that it is quite possible for food remains to become stuck. The easiest way to remove these is to fill the receptacle with soapy water and leave for at least an hour. This will soften the food remains. Then wash thoroughly with detergent and hot water.. When necessary, use hard scourers and scouring powder for cleaning the product.. When clean, lightly oil the receptacle both inside and out and keep it wrapped in paper inside a plastic bag in a dry, safe place.. This type of product has been devised for use on gas or wood-burning hobs.. Never put the receptacle on the heat when empty.. Avoid overheating the recipient.. If using in the oven, do not exceed a temperature of 250°C (480°F) nor a duration of 10 minutes.. Never use in a microwave oven.. Wooden and stainless steel implements may be used. Plastic implements are not recommended.. When in use, every part of the product will become hot. Please take great care and never leave the receptacle on the hob without responsible adult supervision. Keep well out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w6oLqoo0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sur La Table","source_asin":"B00GTZGIYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GTZGIYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GTZGIYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861452,"name":"PILIPILI Bamboo 6 IN 1 Foil and Plastic Wrap Dispenser With Bag Storage Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Food Storage Bag Holder, Foil and Baggie Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EQlUqJSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈Stylish Design Foil Organizer: The new appearance design of the food bag organizer with dispenser makes it easier for you to organize all your kitchen materials together. Exquisite appearance design, golden buckle, smooth surface bamboo material, while storing and arranging all the bags, make your kitchen neat and orderly. 🌷Baggie Organizer: Food bag storage organizer has 4 grids, it's suitable for most brands bags, it can storage quark bags, snack bags, sandwich bags, gallon bags, and the bamboo storage bag organizer designed with large opening, allows you easy yo take bags out. 🌻Foil And Plastic Wrap Organizer: The foil dispenser can be unlocked to change film rolls/cling film/aluminum foil/wax paper etc. The large opening in the middle makes it easy to find the starting line for rolling. With the built-in slide cutter, you will get the job done quickly and effortlessly, cutter can slide in both directions. 🌲Compatible With Most Brands and Materials: 6 IN 1 bag organizer for kitchen plastic bag storage suitable for most brands, the resealable plastic storage bags organizer has laser engraved texts on it, Gallon , Quarts, Sandwiches, Snacks. The plastic wrap organizer below has labels for Plastic Wrap, Parchment, Foil, three labels for you to choose to paste. ❤️Natural Bamboo Material: The material of the plastic wrap dispenser with cutter is pure natural bamboo, well-constructed quality and excellent craftsmanship make aluminum foil organization and storage more solid and durable to last for years. Bamboo is a great alternative to plastic as it is a renewable resource and it will add a warm, natural feel to the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EQlUqJSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PILIPILI","source_asin":"B0B7C314GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7C314GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7C314GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
