window.products.push({"id":861559,"name":"Inkbird Meat Bluetooth Thermometer with 6 Probes, Wireless Digital Smart BBQ Thermometer with Timer, Alarm Magnet, 150ft Grill Thermometer for Grillin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71veeyIsUDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Timer and Alarm & Smart App Control】 6 probes Bluetooth meat thermometer support high and low alarm. The device and phone will trigger the alarm when the setting time or temp reached. Which let you free and have more time to enjoy with your family. No need to worry about overcooking or under-cooking. This Kitchen Grill thermometer has 12 types of meat preset temperatures and different tastes recommended by USDA. And the preset temps can be customized by your own tastes. 【6 Probes Smoker Thermometer】 BBQ thermometer comes with 6 probes, 5 Meat probe and 1 ambient probe. Temperature range is 32° F ~ 572 ° F(Short-time measurement), °32° F~ 482 ° F(continuous monitoring). You can monitor 5 different foods or read grill/oven/smoker surrounding temperature simultaneously. Inkbird smoker Oven thermometer make barbecue cooking more convenient. Note: Please firmly inserted the probes into ports to get accurate readings 【Magnetic Design and Rotatable Screen】 The magnetic design on the back of the digital barbecue cooking thermometer could be adsorbed on the smoker or oven ( Notes: The temperature of the plastic unit can bear should not over 80℃/176F). BTW, double press the power button can give you up and down rotation readable readings. Could keep the high precision after a long period of using. 【Rechargeable Battery Readable LCD】This Inkbird bluetooth grillmeat thermometer is built-in 1000mAh rechargeable lithium battery and comes with 1.64ft USB charging cable. The wireless BBQ Thermometer can last about 40 hours once fully charged. More convenient and environmentally and you can visually observe the battery level on the APP. Please note: The charger requests voltage of 5V and current electric of 1000mAh. 【What You Get】One Inkbird BBQ thermometer + 5 meat probes + 1 oven probes + 2 meat clips + 1 USB charging cable + one manual. Get this nice toy today, skyrocket your grilling performances! One year warranty, probe malfunctions caused by improper use may happen, we will provide free replacement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71veeyIsUDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inkbird","source_asin":"B08CGV5D1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGV5D1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGV5D1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
