window.products.push({"id":861731,"name":"Keystone 50 Pint Portable Dehumidifier, Moisture Absorber for Bathroom, Basement, Garage, and Large Spaces up to 3,000 Sq.Ft. with Continuous Drain Op","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612LPbfqYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Keystone 35-pint dehumidifier removes up to 35 pints of moisture from the air per day in a room up to 3000 square feet. Features include electronic controls with LED display, a 24-hour timer, a transparent water level indicator and a full bucket alert with automatic shutoff. Continuous draining option is available using a low-level drain and a standard garden hose (garden hose not included). It also has a removable, easy-cleaning dust filter with a clean-filter alert. The auto-restart saves your settings during a power outage and the rolling casters make the unit easy to move to another location.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612LPbfqYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEYSTONE","source_asin":"B00IJYH02U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IJYH02U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IJYH02U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861732,"name":"LUXEAR Fruit Vegetable Produce Storage Saver Containers with Lid & Colander 5 Packs BPA-Free Plastic Fresh Keeper Set | Refrigerator Fridge Organizer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m8NYZ2xDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍒【Super Large Capacity】: LUXEAR Produce Keeper includes 5 Containers, 5 Lids and 5 Colanders of varied sizes (24.5 Cup + 16.1 Cup + 9.7 Cup + 5.7 Cup + 3 Cup). To match your different storage needs. These storage containers are perfectly fit for produce, fruits, veggies, meat, fish, lettuces, celery, asparagus, avocados, berries, strawberries, blueberries, salad, bacon and more. 🍋【Keep Produce Fresh Longer】: Compared with ordinary Food Containers, ours each comes with Removable Drain, which can effectively separate your fruits or vegetables from water, prevent water accumulation in the container, prevent fruits and vegetables from soaking and rotten. You can also use the Colanders to wash your fruits and vegetables. Containers for food each included airtight lid, leak-proof, dust-proof and odor-proof. 🍓【Food Grade Safety Material】: LUXEAR Vegetable and Fruit Containers are made of 100% BPA-free PP plastic material, which is durable, flexible and odorless, effectively resist stains, scratch and crack. Safe to use in dishwasher, freezer and microwave(The lids are not microwave safe). Temperature resistance: -4~248℉(-20~120℃). Environmental friendly, Safety and Durability! 🍇【User Friendly Design】: The rectangular shaped Produce Saver stack perfectly to one another to save space and stay organized in the pantry or cabinet. Transparent design helps find stored food faster and better organize food items. Lids with hidden handle design are convenient to carry and prefect to go. Great idea for meal prep, picnic, working lunch, travel, gym and more occasions. 🥦【Our Service Promise】: We know you'll love these 5 Pieces Food Storage Containers, so if for whatever reason the product do not work---we'll give back all cash with no questions asked! You can keep these great Freezer Containers too. Easy to wash and clean, LUXEAR produce containers can be reused and cater to multipurpose storage requirements!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m8NYZ2xDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXEAR","source_asin":"B0BJPPFCY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJPPFCY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJPPFCY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
