window.products.push({"id":861737,"name":"Royal Imports Unscented Taper Candles, Elegant Premium Quality, Dripless & Smokeless, Hand-Dipped Dinner Candles for Wedding, Holiday, Home Decor - 9 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6edOksNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY & SAFETY: Each tall taper candle is crafted of unscented premium quality paraffin wax to enhance its appearance and prevent it from dripping or melting out of shape. Royal Imports tapered candles feature cotton core wicks which enables the candles to burn clean and smoke-free BEST SELLER: These beautiful tapered candles are best sellers for Christmas and Valentines decorations as well as wedding, party and home décor. These dripless & smokeless will enhance any event with its warm light and bring upon a sense of harmony and romance. The set of candles is packaged in an attractive gift box which makes it an awesome gift. Additionally, each box is carefully wrapped to prevent damage in transit. USES: Royal Imports hand-poured tapers are commonly used as party favors, emergency light during power outages, aromatherapy, outdoor patio ambience, restaurant tables etc. Its unique design makes it stand firmly in most candelabras and taper candle holders, which makes these candles stand out from the rest. BURN TIME: Each candle provides approximately 7 Hours of warm ambient light. Because of its extended burn-time, Royal Imports candles can be re-used multiple times, thus adding value to the product. Its beautiful slow glow and extended burn time outperforms most similar candles. DRIPLESS: These Candles are made of high quality wax that will not drip when lit properly. Key is that it burns evenly, therefore do the following: 1) Candles should stand erect/straight, be completely vertical 2) Room should NOT have a strong draft or breeze 3) Do NOT light them too close to each others or other candles/heat sources. To ENHANCE the driplessness do the following, prior to use a) Soak in a strong salt-water solution for 2-hours, dry and use OR b) Store your candles in the freezer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6edOksNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Imports","source_asin":"B09N9ZF17Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N9ZF17Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N9ZF17Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
