window.products.push({"id":861816,"name":"KES Paper Towel Holder Countertop for Kitchen, Beech Wood Paper Towel Holder with Weighted Base SUS 304 Stainless Steel Brushed Finish, KPH802B-2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516OWbH5t0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Weighted Base: The weight of the SUS304 stainless steel base is 3lbs/1.37kg, and the diameter is 7.87\"(20cm). It is heavier and larger than the base of other paper towel racks on the market. The weighted base effectively prevents the kitchen paper rack from tipping over and ensures that it stays in place every time you tear off the kitchen paper. Fits Different Roll Sizes: The wooden rod of this kitchen paper holder is 11.8\" (30cm) long and the diameter of the base is 7.9\"(20cm). It can hold regular 1X, big 1.33X, single plus 1.5X, super 1.83X, double 2X, and double 2.5X rolls. Easy to Grab: You can easily grab the soft, flexible handle at the top of the kitchen paper towel rod to quickly move the holder any place you want it without scratching your hands. Anti-slipping: The package comes with 4 round anti-slip pads that you can stick on the stainless steel base to prevent the countertop paper towel holder from slipping. In addition, this can protect your countertop from scratches. Easy to Assemble: Our kitchen paper towel holder is easy to assemble. Just screw the rod into the stainless steel base. Simply tighten the screw on the bottom of the base with the included Allen wrench and it will be set up within seconds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516OWbH5t0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KES","source_asin":"B09LQ8X9YL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQ8X9YL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQ8X9YL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":861817,"name":"Hot Grillin Products Sure Start Charcoal Chimney Lighter and Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818u5lW6ZNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Easy Charcoal Starter Get grilling faster with the easy-to-use Hot Grillin Products Sure Start Charcoal Chimney Lighter and Stand. This convenient charcoal starter and chimney stand lights your charcoal briquettes, lump charcoal and wood for grilling in just 8-15 minutes, eliminating the guesswork of less-reliable lighting methods like paper or lighter fluid. Simply place this charcoal lighter and chimney stand on a flat, non-combustible surface, carefully ignite a cotton ball soaked with approximately two tablespoons of 91% rubbing alcohol (not included), place your charcoal chimney (not included) over the lighter stand, and let it do its job. You’ll be ready to carefully pour your heated charcoal chimney into the grill within minutes. Keep the Grill Going Bad weather can make for a bad grilling experience, but cookouts are a lot easier with the Sure Start Charcoal Chimney Lighter and Stand. The use of rubbing alcohol and a cotton ball is much more reliable than temperamental paper or lighter-fluid methods. Not only will you know when your charcoal is ready with this reliable method, you will also be better able to predict cook times and temperature ranges as a result. Taste the Difference Enjoy grilled foods the way they were meant to taste. The small amount of clean-burning rubbing alcohol used to ignite this chimney starter won’t produce the aftertaste that grilled foods can have when lighter fluid isn’t completely burned off before cooking. Safe, Clean and Economical At approximately five cents per lighting, this combination of charcoal lighter and chimney stand is an economical option that fits most styles of charcoal chimneys. It doesn’t leave behind unsightly burn marks or mess and, most importantly, it provides a safe place to put your charcoal chimney once emptied. The elevated design creates a safe distance between the ash pan and the surface you place it on, allowing air to flow safely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818u5lW6ZNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Charcoal Chimney Lighter & Stand Combo","source_asin":"B07DHVJ3PV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHVJ3PV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHVJ3PV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
