window.products.push({"id":861845,"name":"Sous Vide Weights (2 pack /4 pack) | Reduce Food Risk | Keep Sous Vide Bags Submerged | Upgrade Solution of Sous Vide Racks (2, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rBKef5W-L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"►KEEP SOUS-VIDE BAGS SUBMERGED Keep food bags in place. Be a sous vide cooking master. No more floating bags in sous vide cooking. No more under-cooked food again. Weights are a cheaper, less cumbersome and more flexible solution than a Sous Vide Rack. ► HEAVY PURE NATURAL HIMALAYAN STONE Until now, most sous vide users have resorted to putting items such as metallic cutlery within bags or carefully placing heavy weights on top of bags to stop them floating. This is an imperfect solution because some metallic cutlery can impact food taste while large weights on the food bags can fall off or severely lower the flow of water to the food bag. JUJUPANDA Sous-vide Weights made of High-density natural Himalayan stone（equivalent to 60x Cents). The weights ensure sous vide bag completely submerged, moreover, keep the taste and nutrients of the food. ►SOLD AS A 2 PACK/4 PACK Each sou vide weight is perfect for normal-sized sous vide bags, however, if you are cooking larger items in a large bag, then you have the option of using additional weight. This product comes as a 4 /2 pack and each weight is fully dishwasher safe. ►WHO ARE JUJUPANDA? JUJUPANDA is a team of people who infatuate Sous-vide food. We are obsessed with finding all kinds of ingredients and cooking methods to get the most delicious food. Since my first taste of a Sous-vide steak, I marveled at the preservation of the taste, flavor, nutrition, and color of food in under vacuum. Since then, I have become a loyal fan of slow-cooking.In our Sous-Vide journey, we have found many key components of vacuum cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rBKef5W-L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOULIFLY","source_asin":"B07D2D8JQ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2D8JQ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2D8JQ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
