window.products.push({"id":861887,"name":"Browne Model #BMP1, Bain Marie Pot, 1-1/4 Qt.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rekM35+-L.jpg","description":"Browne Model #BMP1, Bain Marie Pot, 1-1/4 Qt. Cook and hold delicate foods like rich Hollandaise sauce, creamy custard, and other complex creations with the Browne BMP1 bain marie pot. The stainless steel construction makes the pan durable and resistant to corrosion. With a satin finish interior and mirror-polished exterior, the pan has a classy appearance. This bain marie pot fits a 4.1-inch-diameter opening and allows kitchen staff members to carry their culinary creations from the kitchen directly to the serving line. The Browne BMP1 bain marie pot is great for storing foods, in addition to creating a hot water bath for cooking delicate foods Product Details 1.3-qt. capacity Bain marie pans are used to create a hot water bath for cooking delicate foods and serving hot items Stainless steel construction is easy to clean and resistant to corrosion Mirror finish on the exterior creates a classy appearance Satin finish interior Great for storing food in a reach-in refrigerator or a walk-in Further protect food and prevent spills with the Browne CBMP1 bain marie pot cover Fits an opening of 4.1 in. 4.8 in. depth Bain Marie Pot, 1-3/10 qt., 4-4/5\" dia., fits 4-1/10\" opening, stainless steel, satin finish interior, mirror finish","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rekM35+-L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Browne Foodservice","source_asin":"B077RM4Z5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-861887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077RM4Z5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077RM4Z5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
